From 66b183340a567811051a5745c8d3a53792963860 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego Amicabile <diego.amicabile@soprasteria.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 00:15:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Borg: count an item's light modifier once

borg_notice_equipment() added an item's light modifier to BI_LIGHT
twice - once before the LIGHT_2/LIGHT_3 and Necromancer unlight
adjustments and once after - so a light source's radius was counted
double (a lantern's +2 became +4), inflating every darkness and
out-of-light decision.  Drop the stray second add.

diff --git a/src/borg/borg-trait.c b/src/borg/borg-trait.c
index 154eb3849..9f53feaef 100644
--- a/src/borg/borg-trait.c
+++ b/src/borg/borg-trait.c
@@ -1524,8 +1524,6 @@ static void borg_notice_equipment(void)
             if ((item->modifiers[OBJ_MOD_LIGHT] > 0)
                 && (borg.trait[BI_CLASS] == CLASS_NECROMANCER))
                 borg.trait[BI_LIGHT]--;
-
-            borg.trait[BI_LIGHT] += item->modifiers[OBJ_MOD_LIGHT];
         }
 
         /* Boost mod moves */
